Keep the browser up to date from Grabzy-CC's GitHub releases.

Chromium builds the Google update UI out of non-Google builds, so this
adds a small updater: see chrome/browser/grabzy/grabzy_updater.h.
brand.py writes the release tag into release_tag.h.

